sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Viewer
    actor U as User / Admin
    participant C as Client program<br/>(ollama-python / OpenAI SDK)
    box IAM Gateway (port 8080)
        participant G as Gateway proxy<br/>(access control, forward, audit)
    end
    box Smart Router (new layer)
        participant SR as Smart Router<br/>(ollama_smart_router)
    end
    box Ollama (127.0.0.1 port 11434)
        participant H as Server<br/>(ChatHandler)
        participant S as Scheduler
        participant D as discover
        participant R as Runner process<br/>(llama-server)
    end


    rect rgb(253, 237, 237)
        Note over V,G: Viewer: no inference permission (never reaches the router)
        V->>C: ask a question
        C->>G: POST /api/chat {model: "auto"}<br/>Authorization: Bearer (viewer's key)
        G->>G: check key and role: refused, audited
        G-->>C: 403 Forbidden
        C-->>V: show error
    end

    rect rgb(237, 247, 237)
        Note over U,R: User / Admin: allowed, model chosen by the Smart Router
        U->>C: ask a coding question
        C->>G: POST /api/chat {model: "auto", messages, stream:true}<br/>Authorization: Bearer (own key)
        G->>G: check key and role: allowed
        G->>SR: route(messages, tools, preference)
        SR->>SR: classify request: code, complex
        SR->>H: GET /api/tags, /api/ps
        H-->>SR: installed and loaded models
        SR-->>G: RouteDecision: large coding model,<br/>fallback small model
        G->>H: POST /api/chat {model: large coding model} (key removed)
        H->>H: GetModel(): read manifest and layers from disk
        H->>S: getRunner(model, opts, keepAlive)
        S->>S: put LlmRequest on pendingReqCh
        S->>D: GPUDevices(): free memory per device
        D-->>S: device list
        alt not enough free memory
            S->>S: findRunnerToUnload() and unload idle runner
        end
        S->>R: start process (--model, --port, -c, ...)
        opt chosen model fails to load (fallback, before first token)
            R-->>S: load error
            S-->>H: error on errCh
            H-->>G: error response
            G->>SR: report_failure(large coding model)
            SR-->>G: next model: small model
            G->>H: POST /api/chat {model: small model}
            H->>S: getRunner(small model, opts, keepAlive)
            S->>R: start process for small model
        end
        S->>R: poll until ready (WaitUntilRunning)
        R-->>S: ready
        S-->>H: runnerRef on successCh (refCount = 1)
        H->>H: chatPrompt(): render messages with template/renderer
        H->>R: Completion(prompt, options) over HTTP
        loop for each generated piece
            R-->>H: tokens
            H->>H: Parser splits content, thinking, tool calls
            H-->>G: one NDJSON line
            G-->>C: same line, streamed unchanged
            C-->>U: print text
        end
        H->>S: request finished (finishedReqCh)
        S->>S: refCount = 0, start keep-alive timer (default 5 min)
        G->>G: audit the request (who, chosen model, status)
        Note over S,R: If no request arrives before the timer ends,<br/>the scheduler stops the runner process.
    end
